{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optasia: The Last Visit</strong> is a first-person narrative experience where memory and reality blur. You step into the quiet halls of an asylum\u2014not as an explorer, but as someone searching for answers about family, loss, and the moments that were never meant to slip away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a game of combat or puzzles, but of <strong>atmosphere, discovery, and emotion</strong>. Every room carries fragments of the past tapes, letters, forgotten belongings\u2014that slowly piece together a story only you can uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong> \u2013 uncover a deeply personal story across multiple phases.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dreamlike atmosphere</strong> \u2013 surreal environments, shifting rooms, and symbolic imagery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Found materials</strong> \u2013 discover tapes, letters, and forgotten belongings that bring whispers of the past to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional storytelling</strong> \u2013 crafted to linger long after the final moment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Short but impactful experience</strong> \u2013 designed to be completed in a single sitting.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optasia: The Last Visit is about <strong>the weight of absence</strong>\u2014about the visits we make, and the ones we miss.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018570?t=1760011967","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018570?t=1760011967","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018570/ed8dd86f189197cb6737d6f955cc1aa75b64c4e2/capsu